OEKG:a6dcd178-6ddb-274c-c81e-fbb6495a9c6a a OEO:OEO_00020227 ;
    RDFS:label "Treibhausgasneutralitaet in Deutschland bis 2045 - Ein Szenario aus dem Projekt SCI4climate.NRW"^^XSD:string ;
    OBO:BFO_0000051 <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/models/113>,
        <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/publication/58d6fd4a-95d5-5986-e077-2c4c34f259ae>,
        <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/f5ccf89c-e89c-5b37-1f44-7e9c000b336e> ;
    DC:abstract """The climate policy goals of Germany and the EU require a very rapid and far-reaching transformation of both the energy supply and the energy-consuming sectors. This transformation challenge affects not least the energy-intensive industry in Germany, which is facing fundamental technological changes to important production processes. The challenges for industry are being further exacerbated by the current energy crisis. 

Against this backdrop, the climate protection scenario "SCI4climate.NRW-Klimaneutralitt" (S4C-KN) presented here, which was developed as part of the "SCI4climate.NRW" research project funded by the state of NRW, focuses on possible future developments in energy-intensive industry. The scenario analyzes these developments in the context of an overall economic transformation path towards a climate-neutral Germany in 2045. """^^XSD:string ;
    DC:acronym "SCI4climate.NRW"^^XSD:string ;
    OEO:OEO_00000508 OEKG:534fc9d9-d11f-9e51-544a-6018c2b0260b ;
