<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/360bc5a6-90c6-0aa3-0b7e-93b4c58c1a7c> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "Distributed Energy"^^XSD:string ;
    DC:abstract "Distributed Energy (DE) pictures a pathway achieving EU27 carbon neutrality by 2050 and at least 55% emission reduction in 2030. The scenario is driven by a willingness of the society to achieve energy autonomy based on widely available indigenous renewable energy sources. It translates into both a way-of-life evolution and a strong decentralised drive towards decarbonisation through local initiatives by citizens, communities and businesses, supported by authorities. This leads to a maximization of renewable energy production in Europe and a strong decrease of energy imports."^^XSD:string ;
    DC:acronym "TYNDP-2022-DE"^^XSD:string ;
