<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/520d1e0f-ec0d-8130-42f5-97b97297db27> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label " Klimaschutzszenario 80"^^XSD:string ;
    DC:abstract "In this scenario, the targets for greenhouse gas emissions, renewable energies and energy efficiency set out in the German government's energy concept should be achieved as far as possible, with the less ambitious value (80%) being used for the greenhouse gas target. The biomass potential is restricted and the use of CCS technology is excluded."^^XSD:string ;
    DC:acronym "KS 80"^^XSD:string ;
    OEO:OEO_00020220 <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Germany> ;
