<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/7f1e3589-2523-9d18-5db4-2aa5c9a77410> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "TN-PtG/PtL"^^XSD:string ;
    DC:abstract "The scenarios based on synthetic hydrocarbons (power-to-gas/power-to-liquid (PtG/PtL)) examine different ways of using synthetic hydrocarbons to decarbonize the energy system. The TN PtG/PtL scenario presented here is based on a very strong utilization of synthetic hydrocarbons in the entire energy system. In addition to utilizing the sustainable biomass potential, the required hydrocarbons are imported from regions outside Europe. "^^XSD:string ;
    DC:acronym "TN-PtG/PtL"^^XSD:string ;
    OEO:OEO_00020220 <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Germany> ;
