<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/90873f50-ad04-4a82-abe4-2ff1be730094> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "Low Demand"^^XSD:string ;
    DC:abstract "Low Demand assumes that significant behavioural changes  reducing energy demand  in addition to (shadow) carbon price and technology induced efforts, would mitigate pressure on the economic system to reach global net zero CO2 emissions around 2050."^^XSD:string ;
    DC:acronym "NGFS-LowDemand"^^XSD:string ;
