<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/b7c25295-ee96-2af2-bca7-2af14ea78853> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "With additional measures scenario"^^XSD:string ;
    DC:abstract """A with additional measures scenario (WAM) is a policy scenario that includes policy instruments and transformative measures which have been adopted and implemented to mitigate climate change or meet energy objectives, as well as policy instruments and transformative measures which are planned for that purpose.

The WAM scenario is not a mandatory reporting requirement for European Member States, according to European legislation (the latest being the EU Governance Regulation). 

The datasets (suffix _eio) provided includes the WAM scenario data only for those Member States who provided that data.  The datasets (suffix _eea) includes the WAM scenario data for those Member States who provided the data and a gap-filled column in which the missing WAM data was gap-filled with the WEM scenario data of the same submission year. 

For ease, the countries listed below include all current and former EU Member States. """^^XSD:string ;
    DC:acronym "WAM"^^XSD:string ;
