<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/bbdae7dc-6959-a348-1f61-0251d4016bec> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "TN-Strom"^^XSD:string ;
    DC:abstract "The electrification scenarios are based on the strong use of renewable electricity. The energy demand models calculate scenarios with heavy electricity utilization for their respective sectors. However, a considerable amount of hydrogen is already required here to achieve the goal of greenhouse gas neutrality. Meeting the demand for electricity, heat in heating networks and hydrogen is optimized. The costs of the grids for electricity and gas or hydrogen are taken into account. The use of hydrocarbons is limited to the sustainable potential of biomass by 2050. The TN-Strom scenario presented here represents the basic variant for further planned scenarios in the electrification scenario worlds. "^^XSD:string ;
    DC:acronym "TN-Strom"^^XSD:string ;
    OEO:OEO_00020220 <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Germany> ;
