<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/c566bbf1-0bdf-6f13-1bbd-8046f727a5ca> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "Klimaschutzszenario 95"^^XSD:string ;
    DC:abstract "In this scenario, the targets for greenhouse gas emissions, set out in the German government's energy concept should be achieved as far as possible, with the more ambitious value (95%) being used for the greenhouse gas target. International aviation and maritime transport are included in the scenario as well as LULUCF.The biomass potential and the use of CCS technology are restricted."^^XSD:string ;
    DC:acronym "KS 95"^^XSD:string ;
    OEO:OEO_00020220 <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Germany> ;
