<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/d2035fae-8607-addb-f216-dbc427adc9e4> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "Net Zero"^^XSD:string ;
    DC:abstract """Net Zero explores how different elements of the energy system might change to achieve a substantial reduction in carbon emissions. In that sense, Net Zero can be viewed as a what if scenario: what elements of the energy system might change, and how, if the world collectively acts for CO2e emissions to fall by around 95% by 2050.
Net Zero assumes that there is a significant tightening in climate policies. It also embodies shifts in societal behaviour and preferences which further support gains in energy efficiency and the adoption of low carbon energy."""^^XSD:string ;
    DC:acronym "BP-2024-NetZero"^^XSD:string ;
