<https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/ef7c8632-9048-be78-a46e-a128c3abc57d> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "MGA reference"^^XSD:string ;
    DC:abstract "To compare the benefits and weaknesses of the MAA method compared to state-of-the-art MGA algorithms, a comparison study was performed. Using the MGA method presented, the experiment was repeated for a global CO2 reduction constraint of 95%."^^XSD:string ;
